<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta exchange suspends Multibreeder.</title>
<headline>Jakarta exchange suspends Multibreeder.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta stock exchange suspended trading of minor-sized poultry breeding firm Multibreeder near midsession after a 31.25 percent rise in the price of the stock, brokers and exchange officials said.</p>
<p>Multibreeder rose 250 rupiah, or 31.25 percent, to 1,050 rupiah, with a meagre 84,000 shares changing hands.</p>
<p>&quot;The exchange has suspended Multibreeder near the close of the morning session,&quot; an official with the exchange's monitoring division, who declined to be named, said.</p>
<p>The exchange's directors were not immediately available for comment on the reasons for the suspension.</p>
</text>
